    <figcaption class="visual-caption"><strong>The interface</strong><p>Dashboard, service booking, service details, workshop discovery and profile screens.</p><span class="image-note">FULL PRODUCT VIEW</span></figcaption>
   </figure>
   <figure class="visual-card reveal">
    <div class="visual-toolbar"><span><i></i> USER JOURNEY / CORE AREAS</span><span class="count">02 / 04</span></div>
    <div class="visual-image support-image"><img src="/assets/projects/labib/motojourney.png" alt="MotoServis user journey overview showing home dashboard, service booking, spare parts and profile settings" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.nextElementSibling.style.display='block'"></div>
    <div class="visual-placeholder"><strong>User journey visual</strong><p>Place motojourney.png in /assets/projects/labib/ to display this image.</p></div>
    <figcaption class="visual-caption"><strong>A connected rider journey</strong><p>Four main areas orient the user around discovery, booking, parts and account management.</p><span class="image-note">USER EXPERIENCE MAP</span></figcaption>
   </figure>
   <figure class="visual-card reveal">
    <div class="visual-toolbar"><span><i></i> TECHNOLOGY / IMPLEMENTATION TOOLKIT</span><span class="count">03 / 04</span></div>
    <div class="visual-image support-image"><img src="/assets/projects/labib/mototechstack.png" alt="MotoServis technology stack including Flutter, Dart, Firebase, REST API, GetX, SQLite and Figma" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.nextElementSibling.style.display='block'"></div>
